#MOBILE
Vnum       40001
Keywords   ruhr master temple jedaii~
Short      Master Ruhr~
Long       Master Ruhr sits in quiet contemplation, watching over his students.
~
Desc       An elderly man with a calm, weathered face, Master Ruhr carries
himself with the unhurried patience of someone who has spent a
lifetime teaching the youngest members of the Order. His eyes miss
nothing.
~
