#ROOM
Vnum     40001
Name     Gate of Padawan Kesh~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Encased in pale stone brick and topped with golden spires, the
gate of Padawan Kesh rises before you, marking the boundary between the
wider world of Tython and the Je'daii Academy within. Initiates in
plain robes pass beneath the arch in twos and threes, murmuring to one
another. The path leads north into the outer courtyard.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40002
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40916
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40002
Name     Outer Courtyard~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Smooth flagstones, swept clean each morning, form a wide
courtyard at the heart of the Academy. Initiates cluster in small
groups here between lessons, some meditating, others sparring with
practice weapons under the watchful eyes of their instructors. Paths
lead off in several directions.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40001
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40003
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40005
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40006
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40002 1 40002
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40003
Name     Training Yard~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Sand covers the ground here, raked into careful patterns
between sparring sessions. Wooden practice weapons hang from racks
along one wall, and a low wooden platform marks the center of the
yard where instructors demonstrate technique. The clack of wood on
wood rings out from a dozen pairs of sparring initiates.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40002
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40004
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 40001 5 40003
Reset M 0 40003 1 40003
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40004
Name     Meditation Hall~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     A hushed stillness fills this circular chamber. Rows of
worn cushions ring a shallow pool of clear water at the center of the
floor, its surface undisturbed by even the faintest breath of wind.
Initiates sit cross-legged around its edge, eyes closed, reaching for
the first threads of their connection to the Force.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40003
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    40008
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40005
Name     Lecture Hall~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Tiered stone benches curve around a raised dais at the
front of this hall, where an instructor paces as they speak. Faded
murals along the walls depict scenes from the Order's early history -
the arrival of the Tho Yor, the founding of the nine Temples, the
first Je'daii Masters. Initiates take careful notes on datapads worn
smooth with age.
~
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40002
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40006
Name     Initiate Dormitory~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Rows of simple sleeping mats line this long, narrow room,
each with a small chest of belongings set neatly at its foot. Little
personal decoration is permitted here - the Order teaches that
attachment to possessions is its own kind of imbalance - but a few
initiates have tucked small mementos of home beneath their mats all
the same.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40002
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40007
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 40002 3 40006
Reset M 0 40003 1 40006
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40007
Name     Refectory~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Long wooden tables fill this open hall, worn smooth by
generations of initiates' elbows. The smell of simple, plain food
drifts from a kitchen alcove at the far end. Meals here are eaten in
near silence, one of the Academy's many small lessons in discipline.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40006
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40008
Name     Master Ruhr's Study~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Shelves of ancient texts and star charts line the walls of
this quiet study, tucked away from the noise of the Academy proper. A
low writing desk sits before a narrow window overlooking the training
yard, allowing the Temple Master to watch over his students even
while lost in his own work. The air here carries a settled, patient
calm.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    40004
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40001 1 40008
#ENDROOM

